<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35994" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phĭăla</span></b> ,
			ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιάλη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A broad</i>, <i>shallow</i>, <i>drinking-vessel</i>, <i>a saucer</i>
			(cf. patera), <i><span class="en">Juv. 5, 37</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 8,
				33, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 51,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 41, 1</span></i>;
			14, 95 <i>in lemm.;</i>
			<i><span class="en">Plin. 33,
				12, 55, § 156</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A censer</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. 1 Par.
				28, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Apoc. 5, 8</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
